    "id": 2817,
    "user": "Eric Lewis",
    "role": "student",
    "text": "Goal of the hook is to catch the attention of the reader and introduce the reader to the problem.\nHook is ok. Not binding but acceptable. Instead of 49% feeling positively challenged reverse it for more impact \"51% not positively challenged\". Instead of 11% strongly feels... say for more impact \"89% do not strongly feel...\"",
    "annotationId": 2769,
