  },
  {
    "id": 2818,
    "user": "Eric Lewis",
    "role": "student",
    "text": "Correct observation but still feels to generalized. In order to make the hook more impactful again use for example the consequences for students that are lagging behind to highlight how strong the effect is on the lives of these students showcasing the importance of your problem",
