    "id": 2820,
    "user": "Eric Lewis",
    "role": "student",
    "text": "- Goal: anchor shows how the problem was dealt so far, the domain of the problem, relevance in academia and highlighting the deficits of the current literature.\nWhat is new that we need more research? Good to show examples but what is new that is not already available today?",
